# Details page cards

Related: [feature-page-layout.mdc](feature-page-layout.mdc), [ui-kit-consumption.mdc](ui-kit-consumption.mdc).

Use this pattern for **profile / entity details** pages (view and edit) inside `FeaturePage` — not for paginated list pages ([item-list-pagination.mdc](item-list-pagination.mdc)).

## Required composition

```text
FeaturePage
  actions: Back (always) + Edit | Cancel + Save (page-level — not per card)
  Outer grid: grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3
              (Form wrap in edit → also space-y-0)
    Left stack:  flex flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-2   ← wide cards
    Right stack: flex flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-1   ← narrow cards
      Each section → Card > CardHeader > CardContent (no Edit in header)
```

| Piece | Requirement |
|-------|-------------|
| Shell | `FeaturePage` — full width; no `max-w-*` on body |
| Back | Always in `actions`: `Button variant="outline" size="sm"` + `ArrowLeft` + label (e.g. list name) |
| Edit | **One** page-level `Edit` in `actions` (view). Edit toggles **all** cards to fields |
| Save / Cancel | Page-level in `actions` while editing; `Save` uses `form="<id>"` on the page `Form` |
| Cards | Presentational only — no per-card Edit / Save / Cancel |
| Title density | `CardTitle className="text-lg"` |
| Gap | Same **`gap-6`** on outer grid and both stacks |
| Top align | Outer `items-start`; independent column stacks |
| Edit `Form` | Include **`space-y-0`** — `Form` defaults to `space-y-4` |

## Page actions skeleton

```tsx
actions={
  <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <Button type="button" variant="outline" size="sm" onClick={onBack}>
      <ArrowLeft className="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden />
      Back
    </Button>
    {mode === 'view' ? (
      <Button type="button" size="sm" onClick={() => setMode('edit')}>
        <Edit3 className="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden />
        Edit
      </Button>
    ) : (
      <>
        <Button type="button" variant="outline" size="sm" onClick={onCancel}>Cancel</Button>
        <Button type="submit" size="sm" form="details-form">Save</Button>
      </>
    )}
  </div>
}
```

## Forbidden

- Per-card Edit / Save / Cancel in `CardHeader`
- Flat `<section>` + bare `<h3>` instead of `Card`
- Single full-width card column when sections can split 2+1 at `lg`
- `Form` without `space-y-0` on a multi-column details layout
- `max-w-xl` / centered narrow form wrappers on details pages

